## Commitment (idea-repo)
Deliver, to the standard a specialist would hold:
1. `Brief` wiki page: question, idea, contribution, baselines, evaluation design (done; revised when the idea review or results require).
2. `prior_work.md`: the sources, the closest methods and how the study relates to each (done; the report role turns it into Related Work and bib).
3. Answer baseline questions from `experiment-repo` (which methods, which sources), answer `story-repo` / idea-review feedback by strengthening the idea, not narrowing it.
4. If the main test (headroom on the real datasets) is negative or undecided, carry the direction until it decides, and make that answer and its reason the finding.
